{"title": "The 12th Google Store is opening on November 6", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/google-store-houston/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2023/09/google-store-logo-3.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/04/25/google-store-san-diego/\">San Diego</a> and <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/06/01/google-store-tokyo-to-be-first-physical-store-outside-us-opens-this-summer/\">Tokyo</a> in 2026, the next Google Store is opening in Houston on November 6. This is the company’s 11th retail location in the US and 12th globally.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/google-store-houston/#more-735261\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-10-30T10:37:58+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-04T17:54:35.409444+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Apple Music 7.0 for Android rolls out with Liquid Glass redesign", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/apple-music-7-0-redesign/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/Apple-Music-7-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following a <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/09/30/apple-music-7-0-redesign-liquid-glass/\">month of beta testing</a>, Apple Music 7.0 is rolling out with a Liquid Glass redesign for Android, as well as the new icon for the streaming service.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/30/apple-music-7-0-redesign/#more-735251\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-10-30T08:26:48+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-04T17:54:35.409444+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
